            "sid": "JER 7:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Inɔ lät nikɛ rieet ti diaal ti̱ti̱, kä /ca ji̱ bi liŋ. Kä bi kɛ cɔl, kä /ca ji̱ bi liŋ. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.7.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.7.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 7:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä bi kɛ jiök i̱, ‘Nɛmɛ ɛ jɛn do̱r ëë /ken ruac Kuɔth min la Kuothdiɛn luɔ̱th, kä /ken kɛ luekdɛ liŋ, nɛy tëë ca thuɔ̱k lat kɛ thokdiɛn.’ ”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.7.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.7.28"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Lo̱o̱l na̱k nath",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 7:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.7.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.7.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 7:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cu Kuoth Nhial wee i̱, “Ci ji̱ Juda duer la̱t nhiamdä, cikɛ luak in la palkɛ ɣä thi̱n ya̱r, kɛ läth kuthni jiɛnkiɛn thi̱n. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.7.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.7.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 7:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cikɛ yi̱k To-pɛth täth rɛy lo̱o̱lä ben I-nɔm mi waŋkɛ gaatkiɛn thi̱n kɛ mac ɛ la muc. Ɛ mi /ka̱n la̱r kɛ kä /ka̱n jɛ car. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.7.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.7.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 7:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä kɛ kui̱c ɛmɔ nɛnɛ, ci ni̱n cop tin /ca jɛ bi nyɔk kɛ ciöt thi̱n i̱, To-pɛth, kiɛ lo̱o̱l ben I-nɔm, ba jɛ cɔli lo̱o̱l na̱k nath. Kɛ ɣöö bikɛ naath kony kä To-pɛth amäni mi cɛ thil gua̱a̱th mi dëë raan lɛ kony thi̱n. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.7.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.7.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 7:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ɛ ba ri̱ŋkiɛn cam ɛ diit nhial kɛnɛ ley dɔaar kɛn nɛy ti̱ti̱ ala mi̱ethdiɛn kɛn nɛy ti̱ti̱. Kä bɛ thil ram mi tëk mi bikɛ tuɔ̱r jɔ̱ɔ̱r. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.7.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.7.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 7:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä bä tɛ̈th lɔaac kɛnɛ puɔ̱t buɔ̱li kueni ji̱ Juda kɛnɛ ji̱ Jɛ-ru-tha-lɛm cu moc kɛ pek, kɛ ɣöö bi mun te baaŋ a thil ram mi cieŋ thi̱n.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.7.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.7.34"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
